{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SnowplowEncoding\/documentation\/SnowplowEncoding","doc:\/\/SnowplowEncoding\/documentation\/SnowplowEncoding\/SnowplowBatchEncoder"]]},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"roleHeading":"Type Property","title":"batchLimit","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"property","modules":[{"name":"SnowplowEncoding"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"SnowplowBatchEncoder.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/SnowplowEncoding\/SnowplowBatchEncoder.swift#L125"},"externalID":"s:16SnowplowEncoding0A12BatchEncoderV10batchLimit12PropertyJSON0cF0VvpZ","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"batchLimit"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12PropertyJSON10BatchLimitV","text":"BatchLimit"}]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SnowplowEncoding\/documentation\/SnowplowEncoding\/SnowplowBatchEncoder\/batchLimit","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Snowplow’s trackers’ limits on one request, 25 events and 40,000 bytes of body, and an event"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of up to 150,000 bytes in a request of its own."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/snowplowencoding\/snowplowbatchencoder\/batchlimit"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"batchLimit","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12PropertyJSON10BatchLimitV","text":"BatchLimit","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/PropertyJSON\/documentation\/PropertyJSON\/BatchLimit"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Snowplow’s mobile trackers send at most 25 events and 40,000 bytes in a request by default,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and an event larger than that in a request of its own. A collector refuses a body over 2 MB"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with 413, and a request larger than its stream takes (192,000 bytes on SQS, 1 MB on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Kinesis, by default) becomes a failed event though the collector answers 200. So an event"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of up to 150,000 bytes of JSON is sent alone, within the smallest of those, and a larger one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is left out as "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SnowplowEncoding\/documentation\/SnowplowEncoding\/SnowplowEncodingError\/oversized(byteCount:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://SnowplowEncoding/documentation/SnowplowEncoding/SnowplowEncodingError/oversized(byteCount:)":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The event’s JSON is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"byteCount"},{"type":"text","text":" bytes, more than the encoder’s limit lets one record hold:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"150,000 bytes by default ("},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SnowplowEncoding\/documentation\/SnowplowEncoding\/SnowplowBatchEncoder\/batchLimit","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"), within the smallest of a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pipeline’s streams. Only "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SnowplowEncoding\/documentation\/SnowplowEncoding\/SnowplowBatchEncoder\/requests(for:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" leaves a record out for it."}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/snowplowencoding\/snowplowencodingerror\/oversized(bytecount:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/SnowplowEncoding\/documentation\/SnowplowEncoding\/SnowplowEncodingError\/oversized(byteCount:)","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"oversized","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"byteCount","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"title":"SnowplowEncodingError.oversized(byteCount:)"},"doc://SnowplowEncoding/documentation/SnowplowEncoding/SnowplowBatchEncoder/batchLimit":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"batchLimit","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/snowplowencoding\/snowplowbatchencoder\/batchlimit","identifier":"doc:\/\/SnowplowEncoding\/documentation\/SnowplowEncoding\/SnowplowBatchEncoder\/batchLimit","abstract":[{"text":"Snowplow’s trackers’ limits on one request, 25 events and 40,000 bytes of body, and an event","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of up to 150,000 bytes in a request of its own.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"batchLimit","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"BatchLimit","preciseIdentifier":"s:12PropertyJSON10BatchLimitV","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]},"doc://SnowplowEncoding/documentation/SnowplowEncoding":{"title":"SnowplowEncoding","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Send records to a Snowplow collector as self-describing events, whose schemas come from the tracking plan."}],"kind":"symbol","role":"collection","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/snowplowencoding","identifier":"doc:\/\/SnowplowEncoding\/documentation\/SnowplowEncoding"},"doc://SnowplowEncoding/documentation/SnowplowEncoding/SnowplowBatchEncoder/requests(for:)":{"title":"requests(for:)","abstract":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"batch"},{"type":"text","text":" as the tracker pro